"excerpt":"AMREP Corporation was organized in 1961 as an Oklahoma corporation and, through its subsidiaries, is primarily engaged in two business segments: land development and homebuilding. The Company has no foreign sales or activities outside the United States. The Company conducts a substantial portion of its business in Rio Rancho, New Mexico (\u201cRio Rancho\u201d) and certain adjoining areas of Sandoval County, New Mexico. Rio Rancho is the third largest city in New Mexico with a population of approximately 114,000. Land Development As of April 30, 2026, the Company owned approximately 16,200 acres in Sandoval County, New Mexico.","filed":"2026-07-24","text_path":"text/AXR/0001104659-26-086659-business.txt","text_chars":15423}}